dump ellipse-clipped
sel-feather 3
dump feathered
sel-rect 20 20 50 30
sel-grow 4
dump grown
sel-shrink 2
dump shrunk
sel-ellipse 30 10 61 61
sel-shrink 5
dump ellipse-shrunk
sel-invert
dump inverted
sel-all
sel-shrink 1
dump all-shrunk
sel-ellipse 5 5 80 60
sel-erase
dump erased
sel-ellipse 40 20 70 50
sel-feather 2
sel-fill 3366CC80
dump filled
sel-none
dump nosel
